============================================================

### ReiDoMU::Timing ###
	WarningTime/EventTime in minutes - how long before start the
	warning fires, and how long the event runs.

### ReiDoMU::Location ###
	Map/CordX/CordY   Where a guild member has to stand and type /rei
	                  to claim the throne for their guild.
	GuildMinMembers   Minimum guild size (TotalCount) required to
	                  claim it.
	Placeholder values below (Lorencia, 135/125) - pick a real spot
	that makes sense for your map before enabling this event.

### ReiDoMU::ExclusiveMap ###
	Map   Only members of the last winning guild may enter this map
	      (gate/warp checks, see Gate.cpp/Move.cpp) - access
	      transfers automatically to whoever wins the next event, no
	      manual reset needed. -1 or the node missing = disabled.

### ReiDoMU::Schedule::StartTime ###
	One or more scheduled triggers, matched against the real-world
	clock (-1 = any/wildcard for that field):
	Year/Month/Day/DayOfWeek/Hour/Minute/Second.

### ReiDoMU::GuildReward ###
	WC/WP/GP - WCoinC/WCoinP/GoblinPoint paid to the winning guild.

### ReiDoMU::CharReward ###
	WC/WP/GP - WCoinC/WCoinP/GoblinPoint paid to the winning
	character.

### ReiDoMU::KillGuildReward / KillCharReward ###
	A SEPARATE ranking track from GuildReward/CharReward above: pays
	whichever guild got the most PvP kills on the throne map while
	the event was active (KillGuildReward, split among all online
	members like GuildReward), and whoever personally got the most
	(KillCharReward). Both run every event alongside the throne-claim
	ranking - a guild/character can win one, both, or neither.
	WC/WP/GP - WCoinC/WCoinP/GoblinPoint.
	GensContribution - flat Gens points, 0 = none.
	Also pays an item from EventItemBagManager.xml's
	ITEM_BAG_KING_OF_MU_KILL_GUILD/_CHAR (Data/EventItemBag/192 and
	193 - empty templates, configure your own items).

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

<ReiDoMU>
	<Timing WarningTime="5" EventTime="30" />

	<Location Map="0" CordX="135" CordY="125" GuildMinMembers="1" />

	<ExclusiveMap Map="82" /> <!-- Arkania -->

	<Schedule>
		<StartTime Year="-1" Month="-1" Day="-1" DayOfWeek="-1" Hour="22" Minute="5" Second="0" />
	</Schedule>

	<GuildReward WC="10" WP="0" GP="0" />
	<CharReward WC="8" WP="0" GP="0" />

	<KillGuildReward WC="10" WP="0" GP="0" GensContribution="5" />
	<KillCharReward WC="8" WP="0" GP="0" GensContribution="3" />
</ReiDoMU>
